Insert and configure the processing stations, which process the parts for the specified time before feeding
them back into the factory.
Proceed as follows:
• Insert two stations of type ParallelStation 
  in our sample model.
• Enter the capacity of the processing stations. We entered 5 as the X-Dimension and as the Y-Dimension
respectively. This results in 25 processing places on each station.
• Enter a Processing Time. We decided to use a normally distributed time with the settings below.
