• Insert the base at the intersection of the grid line below the Turntable proper in its center.
• Click the base with the right mouse button and select Make Animatable Object. Type in base as the
name. Click OK in the dialog.
Move Parts On with the Turntable
Plant Simulation Help 10-749
Unpublished work. © 2026 Siemens

• Plant Simulation opens the dialog Edit 3D Properties and selects the tab Joint. Select Revolute Joint
and type in 0 as the Velocity. This prevents that the base below the Turntable also rotates when the
Turntable proper rotates toward the feeder lines. Click OK.
• Run the simulation and watch what happens.
